From: pocket-debs <masterxq@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 12:02:25 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] data: priorities in the default theme, battery-charging event
Description:
 Alerts (incoming call, alarm, timer, cell broadcast) 192, new messages
 and notifications 128, reminders of missed ones 120. New event
 battery-charging (system components) with a constant LED and priority
 64, for a charging indicator that a notification pattern overrides and
 that comes back when the reminder ends. Document the priorities.
Author: masterxq <masterxq@users.noreply.github.com>
Forwarded: no
License: GPL-3.0-or-later (as the patched files)
Last-Update: 2026-11-28
---
